## **2. Check whether the last five pipelines were modified**

Execute:

```
cd ~/lma-pipeline-comparison

while IFS= read -r pipeline
do
    if cmp -s \
        "dev-pipelines/$pipeline.conf" \
        "input-output-review-pipelines/$pipeline.conf"
    then
        echo "$pipeline : NO_CHANGE"
    else
        echo "$pipeline : MODIFIED"
    fi
done < input-output-review.txt
```

If all five show `NO_CHANGE`, no further action is required for those pipelines, provided you have confirmed that their differences are intentional.

If any show `MODIFIED`, review and copy those configurations:

```
